{"id":"07d0eb32ffc2cbc0","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-optimal-plain-machine.md","title":"Universal Plain Description Systems","display":"df-optimal-plain-machine — Universal Plain Description Systems","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-optimal-plain-machine","aliases":["43-df-optimal-plain-machine"],"display":"df-optimal-plain-machine — Universal Plain Description Systems","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"§6.1, universal description system","source_printed_pages":"87","source_pdf_pages":"107","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-optimal-plain-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-optimal-plain-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-optimal-plain-machine — Universal Plain Description Systems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§6.1, universal description system"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"87"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"107"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*=2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\Sigma^*=2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span>、串长及连接运算。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\">\\(U,M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 表示部分可计算性，等式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U(\\rho p)\\simeq M(p)\">\\(U(\\rho p)\\simeq M(p)\\)</span> 表示两边同时无定义或同时有定义且相等。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}(U)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Computable}(U)\\land\\forall M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(M)\\to\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall p\\in\\Sigma^*\\;U(\\rho p)\\simeq M(p)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}(U)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Computable}(U)\\land\\forall M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(M)\\to\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall p\\in\\Sigma^*\\;U(\\rho p)\\simeq M(p)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里只定义有效前缀模拟这一明确的通用性条件；实际复杂度函数另在 df-kolm 中定义。标准有效机器枚举给出这类机器。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，§6.1, universal description system；印刷页 87，PDF 页 107。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]] 的 $\\Sigma^*=2^{<\\omega}$、$\\varepsilon$、串长及连接运算。 $U,M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$；$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 表示部分可计算性，等式 $U(\\rho p)\\simeq M(p)$ 表示两边同时无定义或同时有定义且相等。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma^*=2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"U,M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"U(\\rho p)\\simeq M(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}(U)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Computable}(U)\\land\\forall M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}(M)\\to\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\forall p\\in\\Sigma^*\\;U(\\rho p)\\simeq M(p)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1702,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Sigma^*$ 为部分可计算描述系统；固定满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPlain}(U)$ 的 $U$，见 [[43-df-optimal-plain-machine]]。$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*$，$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$C_M:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}$，$\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty$。自然数及串配对编码采用 [[43-df-pair-coding]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-optimal-plain-machine]] — Universal Plain Description Systems"},{"id":"0a5cea7aef9d8542","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1cb4649e6af56ba4","f357216a7edb035a"]}